markdown-fast

parse.js is a specialised rewrite of the tokenizer, lexer and renderer of
marked 18.1.3 (https://github.com/markedjs/marked, tag v18.1.3, commit
ba50aa95636ac8f97f46446bbfeb04592ed22216), the reference renderer of
competition markdown-render-speed-02. The grammar rules and the tokenizing
algorithm are marked's; the option, hook and extension plumbing is removed and
the dispatch is restricted to marked's default configuration (gfm on, breaks
off, pedantic off, async off). marked is MIT licensed:

